## Open Issues to Be Aware Of
1. Closure + Enrollment need weekly pipeline (not daily)
2. Hard delete mechanism not yet implemented
3. IsActive=1 filter recommended over hardcoded PartnerId IN()
4. Snapshot table should run monthly only
5. Deployment: use Fabric Deployment Pipeline NOT GitHub
6. Metadata data does not move with deployment — needs separate migration pipeline
